{"id":"d_main_23_08_e","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch23","label":"Chapter 23 · Prison"},"label":"The Ark's Decision: B","stage":"23-23 STAGE · End","prev":"d_main_23_08_s","next":"d_main_23_09_s","speakers":{"crow":"Crow","yuni":"Yuni","mihara":"Mihara"},"icons":{"crow":"si_c110_00_s","yuni":"si_c160_00_s","mihara":"si_c161_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_1","text":"Now, the Goddess Squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_OverZone_02","bgArt":"eventscene_overzone_02","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_facetoface","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_2","text":"The ones who gave everything for humanity, \nwho were upheld as shining beacons of hope for the entire human race.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_3","text":"They were unceremoniously tossed to the side the second the Ark was completed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_4","text":"The decision was made all the easier because they were all cut off from the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_5","text":"After that, there was the First Surface Reclamation War.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"GoddessOfVictory","bgArt":"goddessofvictory","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_6","text":"Those who willingly donated their brains to become Nikkes were once again hailed as goddesses of victory.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_7","text":"The campaign failed miserably.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_8","text":"The Ark began to persecute the Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_9","text":"They became useless devices that consumed far too many funds and resources and had nothing to show for it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_10","text":"That's about the time the term Nikkephobia came into being.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ArkRuinIndoor","bgArt":"arkruinindoor","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["crow"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_11","text":"This was also a result of the disconnect between Nikkes and humans.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_12","text":"Then, the ginormous failure of the Second Surface Reclamation War. The first celebrity Nikke, Pretty, passed away. The Goddess Fall incident with Model ZX.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_13","text":"Every time there was a major occurrence along these lines, people in the Ark were moved.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_14","text":"Praise, then persecution. Rinse and repeat. It was a never-ending alternating cycle as to how Nikkes were regarded.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_15","text":"I am convinced that disconnection is the biggest cause of all of this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_16","text":"Nikkes reside in the Ark, but they don't truly exist.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_17","text":"They're digital figments of the imagination, seen only on TV screens.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_18","text":"It's the same dynamic as seeing a fictional character in a TV show and loving or hating them accordingly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_19","text":"Why is it this way, you ask?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_20","text":"Because the people haven't felt it themselves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_21","text":"The Ark doesn't know the fear that comes with going up against a Rapture.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_22","text":"Why?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_23","text":"Also because they haven't felt it themselves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_24","text":"The Ark doesn't thank","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_08_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_08_e_25"